abstract: >-
  First-party engineering whitepapers on interface materials for semiconductor packaging and high-end
  manufacturing: die-attach and conductive silver adhesives, thermal interface materials (TIM1, up to
  60 W/m·K), extreme-temperature adhesives (−255 °C to 1000 °C) and underfill. Covers 3nm GAAFET
  front-end processes, hybrid bonding cleanliness, CoWoS-L and panel-level advanced packaging, HBM4
  stacking, kW-class AI accelerator liquid cooling and co-packaged optics. Full text in Chinese and
  English; the official version of record is https://www.sciteo.com/tech-insights/
keywords:
